* B3_base_rlcmfb_Rs5k, testbench B_ac
* LTspice netlist (PTM 90 nm). Open in LTspice (File > Open, all files) and Run.
* Open loop (RF = 100 MOhm, CF = 1 F set the DC point). Phase margin = 180 + phase of v_at_ugf (printed in the log as (dB, deg)).
.include ptm90.lib
Vdd vdd 0 0.45
Vss vss 0 -0.45
Ib vdd nb 2.5u
Mb nb nb vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M0 t nb vss vss nmos90 W=20u L=180n
M1 a inn t vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M2 b inp t vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M3 a cm vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M4 b cm vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
Ra a cm 300k
Rb b cm 300k
M3P out b vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M4P c a vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M5 c c vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M6 out c vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
Rs out o2 5k
Vml o2 oL 0
Cl oL 0 2p
Rf out inn 100Meg
Cf inn 0 1
Vin inp 0 0 AC 1
.ac dec 50 1 10G
.meas AC a0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT=10
.meas AC ugf WHEN mag(V(out))=1
.meas AC v_at_ugf FIND V(out) AT=ugf
.backanno
.end
